90	        "ST", "STREET",
91	        "RD", "ROAD",
92	        "AVE", "AVENUE");
93	
94	    /**
95	     * The maximum number of owners a single city may contain. Once a city holds this many owners it
96	     * is at capacity and cannot take any more.
